Right.

284
00:09:37,320 --> 00:09:38,439
I'm voting for Guorui.

285
00:09:38,440 --> 00:09:39,760
I'm voting for Guorui too.

286
00:09:40,400 --> 00:09:42,240
Three, two, one, vote now.

287
00:09:43,320 --> 00:09:44,919
Okay, Guorui is out.

288
00:09:44,920 --> 00:09:46,159
Game

289
00:09:46,160 --> 00:09:47,040
over.

290
00:09:48,120 --> 00:09:49,519
What's your word?

291
00:09:49,520 --> 00:09:50,799
Mine is 'fight'.

292
00:09:50,800 --> 00:09:51,920
'Fight'?

293
00:09:52,160 --> 00:09:53,639
I thought they were talking about

294
00:09:53,640 --> 00:09:54,679
what we could put in the dorm.

295
00:09:54,680 --> 00:09:56,720
'When moving to new dorms...'

296
00:09:59,760 --> 00:10:01,879
Alright, the game ends here.

297
00:10:01,880 --> 00:10:03,520
Now we start shopping.

298
00:10:05,640 --> 00:10:06,120
Let's go.

299
00:10:06,120 --> 00:10:07,000
I'm so hungry.

300
00:10:10,560 --> 00:10:11,879
Okay, let's pick this one.

301
00:10:11,880 --> 00:10:12,800
Just these two.

302
00:10:12,800 --> 00:10:13,360
I'll take a red pepper.

303
00:10:13,360 --> 00:10:14,160
Sure.

304
00:10:14,161 --> 00:10:15,240
Fresh milk.

305
00:10:16,320 --> 00:10:17,439
Two yuan's worth of pepper.

306
00:10:17,440 --> 00:10:18,839
Save where we can.

307
00:10:18,840 --> 00:10:20,159
18.9 yuan for 15 pieces,

308
00:10:20,160 --> 00:10:22,840
so that comes to about 1.2 yuan each.

309
00:10:23,480 --> 00:10:24,400
This one is thirty pieces.

310
00:10:24,401 --> 00:10:25,479
Thirty pieces for 24 yuan.

311
00:10:25,480 --> 00:10:27,440
This one is less than one yuan each.

312
00:10:29,520 --> 00:10:30,920
Then I'll take this one.

313
00:10:31,440 --> 00:10:33,119
We got a great deal, didn't we?

314
00:10:33,120 --> 00:10:34,360
I'll buy the eggs.

315
00:10:34,560 --> 00:10:35,639
We took exactly the same thing.

316
00:10:35,640 --> 00:10:36,719
Okay, let's take that one then.

317
00:10:36,720 --> 00:10:37,960
Checking out.

318
00:10:38,240 --> 00:10:39,320
How much do we have now?

319
00:10:39,800 --> 00:10:40,720
This is seven hundred yuan.

320
00:10:42,280 --> 00:10:42,640
Okay.

321
00:10:42,641 --> 00:10:44,119
I'm keeping my budget this tight.

322
00:10:44,120 --> 00:10:46,479
I'm just in charge of taking the instant noodles.

323
00:10:46,480 --> 00:10:48,279
If everyone else fails,

324
00:10:48,280 --> 00:10:49,639
this is our last resort.

325
00:10:49,640 --> 00:10:50,560
Yes.

326
00:10:50,561 --> 00:10:51,999
You're my lifesaver.

327
00:10:52,000 --> 00:10:54,079
Guess if this will be today's

328
00:10:54,080 --> 00:10:55,679
most-praised one.

329
00:10:55,680 --> 00:10:56,879
Let's go.

330
00:10:56,880 --> 00:10:58,559
Ziyu, are you looking forward to dinner tonight?

331
00:10:58,560 --> 00:10:59,800
Really looking forward to it.

332
00:11:01,160 --> 00:11:02,959
Hi, everyone. Hey there, little ones.

333
00:11:02,960 --> 00:11:04,319
Today we're going to play

334
00:11:04,320 --> 00:11:05,679
a different little game.

335
00:11:05,680 --> 00:11:07,759
Zhang Ziyu. I've hit him.

336
00:11:07,760 --> 00:11:08,560
I've kissed him.

337
00:11:09,120 --> 00:11:10,000
I've "killed" him.

338
00:11:10,480 --> 00:11:11,280
I've stabbed him.

339
00:11:11,760 --> 00:11:12,560
I've "killed" him.

340
00:11:13,920 --> 00:11:16,199
"Killed" again.

341
00:11:16,200 --> 00:11:17,439
Do that many people want to "kill" me?

342
00:11:17,440 --> 00:11:18,759
Then I'll think of a word this round.

343
00:11:18,760 --> 00:11:19,680
Okay, sure.

344
00:11:20,080 --> 00:11:21,280
Come on, let's start over.

345
00:11:23,960 --> 00:11:25,200
Time to camp.

346
00:11:28,840 --> 00:11:30,400
Such a green grassland.

347
00:11:33,200 --> 00:11:35,119
Such a pink tent.

348
00:11:35,120 --> 00:11:36,640
Awesome.

349
00:11:39,080 --> 00:11:40,480
This frisbee looks so nice.

350
00:11:40,760 --> 00:11:43,360
Hurry up, Ma Weixian.

351
00:11:44,800 --> 00:11:47,399
This is fun. Why are you just standing there?

352
00:11:47,400 --> 00:11:48,360
Come on, intercept.

353
00:11:48,360 --> 00:11:48,960
Nice.

354
00:11:48,960 --> 00:11:49,960
Alright.

355
00:11:50,200 --> 00:11:51,719
You're bad at it, so just practice more.

356
00:11:51,720 --> 00:11:52,839
You say we look like praying drakes.

357
00:11:52,840 --> 00:11:53,959
When you can't catch the frisbee,

358
00:11:53,960 --> 00:11:55,600
you just wander around in place.

359
00:11:55,800 --> 00:11:57,480
Who just called us praying drakes?

360
00:12:08,120 --> 00:12:09,000
So cold.

361
00:12:09,001 --> 00:12:10,039
Is there any body wash?

362
00:12:10,040 --> 00:12:11,159
Might as well just take a shower.

363
00:12:11,160 --> 00:12:12,480
Three, two, one.

364
00:12:24,000 --> 00:12:25,799
Just like a mermaid.

365
00:12:25,800 --> 00:12:26,880
Delightful.
